examples:
示例接口：
```cpp
class StringSpreadsheetCell : public SpreadsheetCell {
public:
    StringSpreadsheetCell() = default;
    StringSpreadsheetCell(const DoubleSpreadsheetCell& cell) {
        set(cell.getString());
    }
};
```

该构造函数允许使用 DoubleSpreadsheetCell 创建 StringSpreadsheetCell：
```cpp
DoubleSpreadsheetCell source;
source.set(8.4);
StringSpreadsheetCell target{source};
```
